1
00:00:00,186 --> 00:00:02,566
(Leonard:)The viewing area's right over there.

2
00:00:05,108 --> 00:00:08,148
Sheldon, your girl... Date... Person...
Ramona's here.

3
00:00:09,195 --> 00:00:11,785
- Oh, hello.
- Oh, sorry I'm late.

4
00:00:11,948 --> 00:00:14,488
I got caught up reading the draft
of your latest paper.

5
00:00:14,659 --> 00:00:18,329
Did you enjoy the footnote where
I illustrate mirror symmetry by likening it...

6
00:00:18,496 --> 00:00:20,836
(Sheldon:)- ...to The Flash playing tennis with himself?
- So funny.

7
00:00:20,998 --> 00:00:22,328
[LAUGHS]

8
00:00:22,959 --> 00:00:25,589
(Ramona:)The idea that you might be able
to incorporate gravity...

9
00:00:25,753 --> 00:00:29,713
(Ramona:)...I have to tell you,
I found it physically exhilarating.

10
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,760
(Sheldon:)My hypotheses tend to have that effect.

11
00:00:35,847 --> 00:00:38,137
(Ramona:)I'm sorry I didn't bring enough
for your friends.

12
00:00:38,307 --> 00:00:40,687
(Ramona:)I assumed we were going to be alone.

13
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:46,020
(Leonard:)Oh. Yeah. No, we were just going.

14
00:00:46,190 --> 00:00:47,650
(Howard:)To watch, right?

15
00:00:49,444 --> 00:00:53,864
- No. Come on now. We're going out.
- Oh, come on. We'll be quiet.

16
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,410
Come on, let's go.

17
00:00:57,034 --> 00:00:58,244
(Leonard:)Okay, you two.

18
00:00:58,786 --> 00:01:06,026
You just have a nice whatever this is.

